This Thursday, September 24th, Rockstar announced Grand Theft Auto VI: The Goodtime State - Vice City Collection, priced at $399.

<img width="1920" height="1920" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c695aba7-029d-42ee-8ac3-a4f608933ea9" />

Included in the package:

- Double-sided commemorative poster with Leonida's map;

- Leonida Keys sticker poster pack;

- Alligator Macca figurine;

- Oakley® Frogskins™ sunglasses;

- New Era® 9FORTY cap with visor and closure;

- Leonida Keys shoulder bag;

- Magnetic mirror with Alligator Macca;

- Shot glass with Manatee Chunkee;

- Collectible Vice City bar spoon;

- Vice City blade keychain;

- Set of enameled Leonida Keys pins in a metal tin.

IMPORTANT!

The game is NOT included in the edition and is sold separately.

